      "summary": "The bill requires the President to impose visa sanctions\u2014making them inadmissible and revoking visas\u2014against any foreign person the President finds performed or facilitated \"chemical or surgical mutilations\" of U.S. minors. It covers WPATH members, licensed physicians, and medical facilities; defines mutilation to include puberty blockers, sex hormones, and surgeries; exempts treatment for disorders of sexual development and detransition care; and allows whistleblower and national-security exceptions."
