      "status": "AI impact analysis",
      "summary": "The bill directs the President and State Department to bar entry and revoke visas for foreign persons\u2014including World Professional Association for Transgender Health (WPATH) members, foreign physicians, and foreign medical institutions\u2014that provide puberty blockers, sex hormones, or gender\u2011related surgeries to U.S. minors. It requires the State Department to accept public tips, report to Congress within 180 days, and allows UN, whistleblower, and presidential national\u2011security exceptions."
    },
